        ['Google Veo MP4', 'The container layer: credentials and tool fields carried inside the ISO base media box structure rather than an image marker.'],
      ],
      signalRows: [
        ['EXIF', 'A camera-era standard. Software, Artist and UserComment sometimes carry a tool name or a JSON AI label, and a wholesale absence of camera fields is itself mildly informative.'],
