        ['C2PA', 'The signed layer, serialised as JUMBF and embedded per format: an APP11 segment in JPEG, a dedicated chunk in PNG, a box in MP4.'],
        ['PNG text chunks', 'tEXt, iTXt and zTXt hold free-form key/value text, which is why prompts, seeds, samplers and full workflow JSON end up here rather than in EXIF.'],
