        {
          heading: 'Reading metadata without handing over the file',
          body: 'Metadata inspection is a read-only operation on bytes you already have, so there is no technical reason to upload anything. AICheck365 parses EXIF, XMP, C2PA, PNG chunks and MP4 boxes locally through Rust compiled to WebAssembly, which keeps working documents and personal photographs on your own machine. It also means results appear without a round trip, and that large video files are bounded by your hardware rather than an upload limit.',
