      limits: [
        'Everything except a signed C2PA manifest can be edited, removed or copied onto an unrelated file.',
        'Sharing, transcoding, screenshots and re-exports strip these layers at different rates, usually starting with PNG text.',
        'An absence of metadata is not evidence of human authorship — it only means this copy carries nothing readable.',
        'Field names vary between tools and versions, so not every value can be normalised into a tidy label.',
