      ],
      faq: [
        ['Where do AI tools write their metadata?', 'It depends on the tool and the format. Signed provenance goes into a C2PA manifest, descriptive tool names into EXIF and XMP, generation parameters and workflows into PNG text chunks, and video-level details into the MP4 or MOV container.'],
